    {
      "source": "Unwraps a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> that may have been proxied or wrapped in a custom\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Wrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Wrapper</code></a> such as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/datasource/DelegatingDataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource\"><code>DelegatingDataSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "解包一个可能已被代理或包装在自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> 中的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/java/sql/Wrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.sql\"><code>Wrapper</code></a>，例如 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/datasource/DelegatingDataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.datasource\"><code>DelegatingDataSource</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
